OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in crash that shut Orwell
OL,4,ABridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died following a collision
OL,7,Fthat closed a major route in Suffolk.
OL,9,FPolice were called by paramedics to the
OL,10,FOrwell Bridge, which carries the A14
OL,11,Fsouth of Ipswich, at 03:41 BST, after
OL,12,Freports of a person in the westbound
OL,13,Fcarriageway.
OL,15,FThe man, who has not yet been
OL,16,Fidentified, was pronounced dead at the
OL,17,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
