OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in crash that shut Orwell
OL,4,ABridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe A14 was shut in both directions
OL,7,Fbetween junction 56 for Wherstead and
OL,8,Fjunction 57 at the Nacton interchange
OL,9,Fbefore the eastbound carriageway, for
OL,10,FFelixstowe, reopened at about 15:45.
